msgid "⟪k:0⟫But above all, she loved to say,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫最重要的是，⟪k:1⟫母亲反复提及这句话。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_40CC3113_166E_4F46_AB19_9B65026E3104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
