msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tales of heroes of old and dauntless soldiers. ⟪k:1⟫Military texts written by tacticians in "
"the midst of war."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫去读过去的英雄和军事家的故事，⟪k:1⟫去读战时参谋留下来的兵法。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_02D63A4D_36B0_451F_BA0D_A97A383C2A42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a064f209aae0edfcf7809b2d1a94f9f6afdfe05410d787e93885fb0b34ad459
