msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Thinking about them set my heart aflutter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and made me think about my brother. ⟪k:3⟫"
"He was training to be a knight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫书本会让我欢喜雀跃，⟪k:1⟫让我想起哥哥的声音。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫和他即将踏上的骑士之路——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB9D7E3E_A529_401F_AD7D_FB5D1B459759
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75489f7b83ee4ed9fdd5ac0c782bff47881e034e628761a91d08009234d7f888
