msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CEA3EE3_8726_48B8_852E_D58FAF6208A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Soon, I found myself in my fantasies,⟪k:1⟫imagining how the sword would feel in my hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫当我畅游于想象之域，⟪k:1⟫不光想象武具的模样，⟪k:2⟫还想象那种把武器拿在手中的实实在在的触感。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D6C3525_8C8E_4717_9B51_FB0174D081E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9517b7e508f476626a7e96775e1715b15e4f7280a8c894796de6ad5fac2267b2
