msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BB693CB4_54E7_4048_868C_F6CFB4159481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How restricted would my vision be wearing a helmet?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How much did it weigh? How hot "
"was it inside?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫想象带上头盔，⟪k:1⟫视野会收缩成什么样。⟪k:2⟫想象头盔的重量、⟪k:3⟫带着头盔时的闷热。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"想象挥剑时，⟪k:6⟫手会受到多少反作用力。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E13C4293_797F_4238_B34F_42B0A92CD7C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3916302fb4bc163548a55fbac5068741d7d57027ed0f16a50109c96a8ebb6b2
