msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫你已经练习了很久呢。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A0DBDD17_4A04_49B0_BAE8_A7578E73066D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20bd799f654c8d030016cfd8623ff93552fb28cf22697d9039fc2e2e1806033f
